(7567328, 1214084, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>This is an appealing landscape with your choice of composition featuring the water so prominently it takes you into the image as a whole nicely. Its even more interesting that there it is pure natural landscape alone with no other signs of life of any sort, which, of course, would not be the case its just not evident. There is unfortunately some detail lost in the highlights that may have been reduced during the exposure but good detail in the landscape itself. Well done for the high score and placement Janine</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that contributes well to the challenge This is an appealing landscape with your choice of composition featuring the water so prominently it takes you into the image as a whole nicely. Its even more interesting that there it is pure natural landscape alone with no other signs of life of any sort, which, of course, would not be the case its just not evident. There is unfortunately some detail lost in the highlights that may have been reduced during the exposure but good detail in the landscape itself. Well done for the high score and placement Janine', '2018-04-30 07:45:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(7567332, 1214064, 135744, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Paul:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/>Yep - when its hot, they go down for the day. Ive got pictures somewhere. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Wow that I would love to see in pictures and even more so to see in real life.</td>', 'Originally posted by Paul: Yep - when its hot, they go down for the day. Ive got pictures somewhere.   Wow that I would love to see in pictures and even more so to see in real life.', '2018-04-30 08:38:28.000000', NULL, 0),
